":["Writes","Space","Balance"],"captions":["Every insert and update touches all table indexes — writes slow down","Every index takes space on disk and in memory","Add an index for a specific query; write-heavy tables get fewer"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"w","x":60.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":30.0,"text":"INSERT","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a","x1":100.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":120.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"t","x":170.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":30.0,"text":"table","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"i1","x":280.0,"y":40.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"index 1","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"i2","x":280.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"index 2","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"i3","x":280.0,"y":100.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"index 3","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"t","x":100.0,"y":70.0,"w":130.0,"h":40.0,"text":"table\n100 MB","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"i","x":280.0,"y":70.0,"w":130.0,"h":40.0,"text":"indexes\n+70 MB","tone":"yellow","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a~cell","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"w":150.0,"h":40.0,"text":"many reads:\nmany indexes","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":70.0,"w":150.0,"h":40.0,"text":"many writes:\nfew indexes","tone":"yellow","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[12.0,23.9]}]},{"title":"Selectivity","sub":"How many rows it filters out","short":"Selectivity","main":"An index on a two-value column is almost useless.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Unique","Two values","Statistics"],"captions":["email is unique: the condition returns one row — the index is ideal","vip = 0 or 1: the condition returns half the table — a scan is cheaper","ANALYZE gathers statistics the optimizer uses to estimate selectivity"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":36.0,"tex